
@startuml

title Sequence Diagram 2 - Guest Check-in and Check-out

autonumber

actor "Hotel Staff" as Staff
actor Guest
boundary "Hotel Application" as UI
control "HotelFacade" as Facade
control "ReservationService" as ReservationService
entity "Reservation" as Reservation
participant "ConfirmedState" as Confirmed
participant "CheckedInState" as CheckedIn
participant "CompletedState" as Completed
control "RoomService" as RoomService
entity "Room" as Room
control "ReservationEventPublisher" as Publisher
participant "EmailNotifier" as Email
participant "SmsNotifier" as SMS
participant "AuditLogObserver" as Audit

== Guest Check-in ==

Staff -> UI: Enter reservation ID
UI -> Facade: checkIn(reservationId)
Facade -> ReservationService: checkIn(reservationId)
ReservationService -> ReservationService: Retrieve reservation

alt Reservation exists

    ReservationService -> Reservation: Get current state
    Reservation --> ReservationService: ConfirmedState

    ReservationService -> Reservation: checkIn()
    Reservation -> Confirmed: checkIn(reservation)

    alt Reservation is confirmed

        Confirmed -> Reservation: setState(CheckedInState)
        Reservation --> Confirmed: State updated
        Confirmed --> Reservation: Check-in successful

        ReservationService -> RoomService: updateRoomStatus()
        RoomService -> Room: updateStatus()
        Room --> RoomService: Room status updated
        RoomService --> ReservationService: Update successful

        ReservationService -> Publisher: notifyObservers(reservation, "CHECKED_IN")

        Publisher -> Email: update(reservation, "CHECKED_IN")
        Email -> Email: sendEmail()
        Email --> Publisher: Email sent

        Publisher -> SMS: update(reservation, "CHECKED_IN")
        SMS -> SMS: sendSms()
        SMS --> Publisher: SMS sent

        Publisher -> Audit: update(reservation, "CHECKED_IN")
        Audit -> Audit: recordEvent()
        Audit --> Publisher: Event recorded

        Publisher --> ReservationService: Notifications completed

        ReservationService --> Facade: Check-in successful
        Facade --> UI: Display check-in confirmation
        UI --> Staff: Check-in completed
        UI --> Guest: Display welcome message

    else Invalid reservation state

        Confirmed --> Reservation: Check-in rejected
        Reservation --> ReservationService: Invalid state
        ReservationService --> Facade: Check-in failed
        Facade --> UI: Display error
        UI --> Staff: Check-in not allowed

    end

else Reservation does not exist

    ReservationService --> Facade: Reservation not found
    Facade --> UI: Display error
    UI --> Staff: Reservation not found

end

== Guest Check-out ==

Staff -> UI: Select reservation and request checkout
UI -> Facade: checkOut(reservationId)
Facade -> ReservationService: checkOut(reservationId)
ReservationService -> ReservationService: Retrieve reservation

alt Reservation exists and guest is checked in

    ReservationService -> Reservation: checkOut()
    Reservation -> CheckedIn: checkOut(reservation)

    CheckedIn -> Reservation: setState(CompletedState)
    Reservation --> CheckedIn: State updated
    CheckedIn --> Reservation: Check-out successful

    ReservationService -> RoomService: updateRoomStatus()
    RoomService -> Room: updateStatus()
    Room --> RoomService: Room status updated
    RoomService --> ReservationService: Update successful

    ReservationService -> Publisher: notifyObservers(reservation, "CHECKED_OUT")

    Publisher -> Email: update(reservation, "CHECKED_OUT")
    Email -> Email: sendEmail()
    Email --> Publisher: Email sent

    Publisher -> SMS: update(reservation, "CHECKED_OUT")
    SMS -> SMS: sendSms()
    SMS --> Publisher: SMS sent

    Publisher -> Audit: update(reservation, "CHECKED_OUT")
    Audit -> Audit: recordEvent()
    Audit --> Publisher: Event recorded

    Publisher --> ReservationService: Notifications completed

    ReservationService --> Facade: Check-out successful
    Facade --> UI: Display checkout confirmation
    UI --> Staff: Check-out completed
    UI --> Guest: Display goodbye message

else Invalid reservation state or reservation not found

    ReservationService --> Facade: Check-out rejected
    Facade --> UI: Display error
    UI --> Staff: Check-out cannot be completed

end

@enduml
